  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math> are two matrices given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "a non-identity symmetric matrix",
      "is_correct": true
